# builtin-read-chunk: boundary read — exactly fills chunk, then EOF
# Verifies: reading exactly n bytes when n == length produces full content;
# subsequent read at EOF returns []
--- uses: ["core"]
[h: [string-handle "abcd"]]
[chunk: [builtin-read-chunk h 4]]
[eof: [builtin-read-chunk h 4]]
[str [bytes-str chunk] "/" [= eof []]]
=== out
String("abcd/true")
